UlaCache is distributed under Apache-2.0.

The cache and SGLang adapter sources derive in part from FlowKV/SGLang.
The single framework patch targets official SGLang v0.5.22, commit
baa9befa381511cd4d56f83980951e5a45fffc6d (Apache-2.0).

Native sources under ulacache/csrc retain their original copyright notices.
The FlashAG headers provide the Index communication implementation used by UlaCache;
its provenance is recorded in ulacache/csrc/flashag/b300/PROVENANCE.json.

The scheduler ablation includes adapted SGLang HiSparse metadata kernels,
identified separately under ulacache/csrc/kvcacheio/.

Third-party CUDA ABI names and historical dataset labels retain their original
spelling. Relocating a native include changes its path, not its algorithm.
